"Reproduce only this bounded metadata reconciliation, on CPUs8\u201323:\n\n    taskset \u002dc 8\u002d23 python3 \u002dB /tmp/m6\u002dt46\u002dd\u002dsupport\u002d9n7pqu00/readback.py\n\nThe comparator is independent support code. It never imports or invokes committed audit programs. It reads named Git records into memory and authorized ordinary publication handles, compares hashes/JSON metadata/numbered receipt ranges, and writes private metadata outputs only. Exit0 means the comparison completed; inspect results.json mismatches. Its retained earlier\u002dversus\u002dfinal input mismatch is intentional and is not waived. Rerunning updates private results and command/hash journals, so the packet manifest identifies the delivered snapshot, not future reruns.\n\nExact Git command families (absolute root throughout; no fetch/checkout/index mutation):\n\n    taskset \u002dc 8\u002d23 git \u002dC /workspace/repos/pixelelated/distribution.worktrees/m6\u002drenovation\u002dplan\u002d346 show 647a8831739ffa28995e1955e68225ca0226c926:docs/reviews/briefs/records.md\n    taskset \u002dc 8\u002d23 git \u002dC /workspace/repos/pixelelated/distribution.worktrees/m6\u002drenovation\u002dplan\u002d346 show \u002ds \u002d\u002dformat=%P a0d4c4fda7a0c16c04d57edf921ffeb741eff19b\n    taskset \u002dc 8\u002d23 git \u002dC /workspace/repos/pixelelated/distribution.worktrees/m6\u002drenovation\u002dplan\u002d346 rev\u002dlist 8710a6210a40de0110244d03a886161ee06faf29..a0d4c4fda7a0c16c04d57edf921ffeb741eff19b\n    taskset \u002dc 8\u002d23 git \u002dC /workspace/repos/pixelelated/distribution.worktrees/m6\u002drenovation\u002dplan\u002d346 diff \u002d\u002dname\u002dstatus 8710a6210a40de0110244d03a886161ee06faf29 a0d4c4fda7a0c16c04d57edf921ffeb741eff19b\n\nreadback.py records exact show/ls\u002dtree/cat\u002dfile paths and immutable refs in commands.jsonl. ls\u002dtree supplies only mode/type/OID/size metadata for four canonical inputs at source/seed/D. cat\u002dfile \u002d\u002dbatch reads the314 named changed records, not an exported tree. Text inspection used immutable show for the named audit programs, receipts and prose. Named\u002dtransport recovery is json.loads of retained JSON in memory; neither decoded sensitive\u002dlabelled path text nor source bodies are written out.\n\nExternal ordinary root: /tmp/m6\u002dt46\u002dd\u002dpublication\u002dpqw4z0xj. readback.py opens / then each directory component with O_DIRECTORY|O_NOFOLLOW, and each named leaf with O_NOFOLLOW|O_NONBLOCK followed by fstat regular\u002dfile/size checks. Every observed content hash is in observed\u002dhashes.json. No other private directory is consulted.\n\nLive reads used GitHub connector github_fetch_issue for693/1417/1416, github_fetch_issue_comments for the complete693 thread, and github_fetch GET https://api.github.com/repos/pixelelated/distribution/issues/{693,1417,1416}/parent. Saved response facts are live\u002dissues.json/live\u002dparents.json. Important comment IDs: dispatch6604232125 and checkpoint6604179796. These are time\u002dspecific readbacks, not ongoing polling or tracker writes. The reproducible comparator uses the retained responses.\n\nThe producer's actual argv/exit/streams are evidence only in results.json facts.audit_receipt_bindings/publication_bindings/inner_checkpoint_readback. Do not execute those producer commands to reproduce this support. No accepted historical evidence was rerun.\n"
